OL,3,AHuawei found guilty of stealing trade
OL,4,Asecrets but acquitted of racketeering
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuawei said the racketeering acquittal
OL,7,F"confirms that these allegations lack
OL,8,Ffactual basis", adding that it would
OL,9,F"take all necessary legal actions to
OL,10,Fdefend our rights and interests".
